      "en": "The waters surrounded me, even to the soul. The deep was around me. The weeds were wrapped around my head.",
      "ko": "물이 나를 둘렀으되 영혼까지 하였사오며 깊음이 나를 에웠고 바다 풀이 내 머리를 쌌나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "117246414fbe8ae556952ce59e511f4433284063fb0d282c9dd9e5d36fa76926",
      "translation_text_hash": "f31aeeb545273cb13e81feef2fc00acb1771f41cff5411d2a850bbf2236d0119",
