      "en": "Those who regard vain idols forsake their own mercy.",
      "ko": "무릇 거짓되고 헛된 것을 숭상하는 자는 자기에게 베푸신 은혜를 버렸사오나",
      "source_text_hash": "6bf3aa456b4f9ee68a62b3a679d00445fe29eb70d02e4368c55ba95590336081",
      "translation_text_hash": "2a001c03daf84b92bd0d8f4d49f26b41f9d658e8df61792b978b18c492b9514a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
