      "en": "Then the LORD spoke to the fish, and it vomited out Jonah on the dry land.",
      "ko": "여호와께서 그 물고기에게 명하시매 요나를 육지에 토하니라",
      "source_text_hash": "fc5978dd67f4b8a261fc3d4ccec9dee16fe55f36b53e70afefc2792962d88203",
      "translation_text_hash": "e8e9de8cf00b2ac631f192d4ca2eba3943876a6faf5da01b1bbd8f8850adc0f3",
